    <https://doi.org/10.1017/pab.2021.31> dct:title "Ediacara growing pains: modular addition and development in Dickinsonia costata" .
    <https://doi.org/10.1098/rspb.2017.1348> dct:title "Quantitative study of developmental biology confirms Dickinsonia as a metazoan" .
    <https://doi.org/10.1098/rstb.1952.0012> dct:title "The chemical basis of morphogenesis" .
    <https://doi.org/10.1126/science.aat7228> dct:title "Ancient steroids establish the Ediacaran fossil Dickinsonia as one of the earliest animals" .
